              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "die Prognose — \"the forecast, the prognosis\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Die Prognose für das Wochenende ist gut: viel Sonne. The forecast for the weekend is good: lots of sun."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: die Prognosen. Eine Prognose stellen — to make a forecast; a doctor's prognosis too."
            }
          ]
        },
